request.description:
Missing entity / account codes

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-05",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "gaps": [
    {
      "code": "MISSING_ENTITY",
      "accountCode": "1700",
      "message": "No master entity for intercompany account 1700"
    }
  ]
}
```

Book account balances

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-06",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "bookBalances": [
    {
      "accountCode": "4000",
      "accountName": "Ordinary Income",
      "bookAmount": 1250000,
      "currency": "USD"
    },
    {
      "accountCode": "5000",
      "accountName": "Guaranteed Payments",
      "bookAmount": 80000,
      "currency": "USD"
    },
    {
      "accountCode": "1700",
      "accountName": "Depreciation",
      "bookAmount": -45000,
      "currency": "USD"
    }
  ]
}
```

Tax attribute corrections

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-08",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "attributeGaps": [
    {
      "field": "section754Election",
      "severity": "warning",
      "message": "Confirm 754 election status for tax year"
    }
  ]
}
```

Book-to-tax reconciling asks

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-09",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "bttAsks": [
    {
      "accountCode": "1700",
      "ask": "Provide tax depreciation schedule for book-to-tax",
      "priority": "high"
    }
  ]
}
```

Ownership validation issues

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-12",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "ownershipIssues": [
    {
      "partnerId": "P-002",
      "issue": "Ownership % drift vs capital ratio",
      "suggestedOwnershipPct": 40
    }
  ]
}
```

Adjusted tax amount needs

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-13",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "allocationNeeds": [
    {
      "bucket": "ordinaryIncome",
      "requiredAmount": 1180000,
      "reason": "Special allocation SA-12"
    }
  ]
}
```

Legal name / EIN for forms

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-15",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "printNeeds": [
    {
      "field": "legalName",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "field": "ein",
      "required": true
    }
  ]
}
```

Tax line amounts for forms

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-16",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "taxLineNeeds": [
    {
      "form": "1065",
      "line": "22",
      "description": "Ordinary business income"
    }
  ]
}
```

Partner capital restatement

Sample:
```json
{
  "contractId": "CT-17",
  "engagementId": "ENG-2025-1065-001",
  "entityId": "ENT-ALPHA-LP",
  "capitalRestatement": [
    {
      "partnerId": "P-001",
      "beginning": 500000,
      "ending": 658000,
      "restatementReason": "Forms package capital rollforward"
    },
    {
      "partnerId": "P-002",
      "beginning": 320000,
      "ending": 401000,
      "restatementReason": "Forms package capital rollforward"
    }
  ]
}
```
